The other day, playing Lo-Levc the Wizard (317th reincarnation - wizards
are hard to start!) I had something strange happen...

Started with:

2 blessed scrolls of identify
blessed scroll of enchant armor
spellbook of haste self
ring of conflict
ring of regeneration
wand of polymorph (7)

So, onward - with +1 cloak of magic prot.  Get to level 2 (np bones levels
yet...bad luck with dese wizards) and find an "Antique Weapons Shop" with
the following:

14 poisoned +2 arrows
blessed -1 elvish bow
blessed +1 speed boots
bronze plate mail
shield of reflection
+2 leather gloves

So, I rack up about 1000 or so GPs in debit and attack the shopkeeper with
the polymorph wand (after getting some good items with the wand
first...i.e. +1 two-handed sword)

Then the shopkeeper is transformed into a bugbear.  Shoot poisoned arrows
at him - 3 gets rid of him - and look where he was...oval key, 5000 gold
(about) and a "statue of a bugbear-shopkeeper named Rath Loric"...what is
that thing????

P.S. - three levels down, a 9th level Lo-Levc died because of a Magic Trap
creating about 3 gray dragons and paralyzing me...one of them survived and
killed me!!!  RATS!

